<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3694/99  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7805/10  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0044/54  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4655/65  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     36.76/77   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.0160/70  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1728.0/8.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.77/82  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7736/12  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.4324/19  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.7802/49  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6876/81</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$320.50/00</p>
</text>
